      "published_at": "2026-10-06T13:24:25Z",
      "title": "I've talked about how I think Joan Beringer is in for a big year. He looks like he spent a lot of time on his body. He's a lot more filled out this year, especially in the upper body. This sequence is what the Wolves need from him, along with good rim protection. Good end-to-end ",
